          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengoba iNkosi ilinikile iSabatha, iyalinika ngosuku lwesithupha isinkwa sensuku ezimbili; hlalani kube yilowo lalowo endaweni yakhe, kungaphumi muntu endaweni yakhe ngosuku lwesikhombisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
